WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 21

01:40.180 --> 01:42.810
Lin Gong joined hands with Si Lili

01:42.860 --> 01:45.070
to try to assassinate Fan Xian on Niulan Street,

01:45.090 --> 01:46.750
but Si Gujian lost a disciple and a follower

01:46.770 --> 01:48.480
during the process.

01:48.500 --> 01:49.990
The two female assassinators

01:50.010 --> 01:51.630
were killed by Fan Xian.

01:51.650 --> 01:52.880
Why did Si Gujian kill Lin Gong

01:52.900 --> 01:54.630
to take revenge?

01:54.650 --> 01:56.110
Everyone knows that

01:56.130 --> 01:58.800
Si Gujian is obsessed with swordsmanship.

01:58.820 --> 02:00.240
Fan Xian killed the two assassinators

02:00.300 --> 02:02.810
when he was attacked.

02:02.860 --> 02:04.180
Si Gujian would think highly of him

02:04.180 --> 02:05.390
because of his capabilities.

02:05.410 --> 02:07.490
And he'd only take revenge on

02:07.690 --> 02:11.270
Lin Gong and Beiqi

02:11.290 --> 02:14.630
that are behind all this.

02:14.650 --> 02:15.970
Wait.

02:16.450 --> 02:18.450
How does it relate to Beiqi?

02:18.450 --> 02:19.430
Your Majesty,

02:19.450 --> 02:22.990
Lin Gong tried to assassinate Fan Xian

02:23.010 --> 02:25.160
because he was fooled by secret agents.

02:25.180 --> 02:28.760
Beiqi disturbed the peace in the capital city

02:28.780 --> 02:29.980
and then got Si Gujian

02:29.980 --> 02:30.830
involved into this case.

02:30.850 --> 02:33.060
They're really evil-minded.

02:33.060 --> 02:36.760
Your Majesty, please dispatch troops

02:36.900 --> 02:39.690
and go on a punitive expedition against Beiqi.

02:40.010 --> 02:42.710
What? Dispatch troops?

02:42.730 --> 02:44.040
Exactly.

02:50.260 --> 02:51.610
Dispatch troops?

02:54.370 --> 02:56.280
We can't do that without careful thought.

03:01.980 --> 03:06.250
Prime Minister, what do you think?

03:09.650 --> 03:11.090
Prime Minister.

03:12.900 --> 03:16.190
Your Majesty,

03:16.210 --> 03:18.640
I beg you to bring fair back

03:18.980 --> 03:20.570
to my dead son.

03:20.570 --> 03:22.430
Prime Minister, you're the most important official.

03:22.450 --> 03:23.450
Come on. Rise.

03:23.450 --> 03:25.600
Your Majesty,

03:25.620 --> 03:27.630
I beg you to bring fair back

03:27.650 --> 03:30.970
to my dead son!

03:41.290 --> 03:44.520
In this case, I'll order

03:44.540 --> 03:47.760
Dongyi Town to hand over the killer.

03:49.930 --> 03:52.970
As for Beiqi...

03:53.780 --> 03:55.530
I've never thought about

03:56.370 --> 03:58.760
getting into a fight with them,

03:58.780 --> 04:00.680
but they've gone too far in bullying us.

04:00.700 --> 04:02.610
They're pressing on step by step.

04:02.650 --> 04:04.000
So,

04:06.340 --> 04:08.280
let's go to war.

04:14.010 --> 04:16.540
I'll take a nation's strength

04:16.540 --> 04:19.250
to punish the wicked.

04:22.420 --> 04:27.600
I see.

04:30.170 --> 04:31.190
Good.

04:31.210 --> 04:34.600
Everything is clear now.

04:34.890 --> 04:36.250
You!

04:36.490 --> 04:37.350
Your Majesty.

04:37.370 --> 04:38.910
You slandered your brother,

04:38.930 --> 04:40.840
so you'll be grounded for three days.

04:40.860 --> 04:42.280
Read more classics.

04:42.300 --> 04:43.690
Both of you can leave.

04:52.170 --> 04:53.600
Your Highness.

04:59.610 --> 05:00.330
As brothers,

05:00.330 --> 05:01.770
we haven't had a heart-to-heart talk for long.

05:01.770 --> 05:05.040
How about getting together someday?

05:06.050 --> 05:09.290
I'll be grounded for three days.
I don't dare to disobey the order.

05:20.980 --> 05:22.320
Prime Minister,

05:23.540 --> 05:24.820
you lost your son.

05:24.820 --> 05:26.720
I understand how you're feeling,

05:26.740 --> 05:29.200
but the war is going to start.

05:29.370 --> 05:31.030
You have to take good care of yourself.

05:31.050 --> 05:32.920
The six ministries need your management.

05:33.490 --> 05:35.200
I have

05:36.490 --> 05:39.720
mixed feelings

05:41.260 --> 05:43.410
that are beyond words.

05:44.020 --> 05:46.880
It's okay as long as it's clear in your mind.

05:46.930 --> 05:48.150
Your Majesty,

05:48.170 --> 05:51.090
I have one more request.

05:51.090 --> 05:52.690
Go ahead.

05:52.820 --> 05:56.440
Now that the whole thing came to light,

05:57.580 --> 05:59.410
I hope Head Chen

06:00.170 --> 06:02.040
can have my son's body

06:02.610 --> 06:05.200
sent to my mansion.

06:05.980 --> 06:08.130
He made a big mistake,

06:08.770 --> 06:11.320
but he's my son, anyway.

06:12.050 --> 06:17.090
I want to have his bones buried.

06:17.210 --> 06:19.530
It's only right and proper.

06:20.420 --> 06:22.130
I'll have him

06:22.330 --> 06:25.570
sent back later.

06:27.020 --> 06:32.250
In this case, your subordinate takes his leave.

06:33.490 --> 06:34.880
Prime Minister.

06:38.610 --> 06:39.920
Prime Minister,

06:40.490 --> 06:42.090
considering what happened between your son and Fan Xian,

06:42.090 --> 06:43.850
do you want to

06:44.420 --> 06:47.040
invalidate Wan'er's marriage contract

06:48.300 --> 06:50.330
to Fan Xian?

06:50.330 --> 06:54.880
It's my son that made a mistake.
It has nothing to do with Fan Xian.

06:55.740 --> 06:59.290
Besides, Fan Xian did a lot

06:59.770 --> 07:03.000
to chase secret agents of Beiqi.

07:03.020 --> 07:04.970
We don't need to

07:06.300 --> 07:07.880
invalidate their marriage contract.

07:08.170 --> 07:09.350
You lost your son.

07:09.370 --> 07:10.440
According to etiquette,

07:10.460 --> 07:12.870
no wedding ceremonies
should be held in three years in your mansion.

07:12.890 --> 07:14.200
Wan'er

07:14.460 --> 07:17.370
has nothing to the Lin mansion in name.

07:17.580 --> 07:18.820
They can get married

07:18.820 --> 07:20.810
as scheduled.

07:20.930 --> 07:23.720
Right. It makes sense.

07:23.740 --> 07:25.750
Their marriage contract will remain unchanged.

07:25.770 --> 07:27.750
But the war is going to begin,

07:27.770 --> 07:29.290
so let's talk about their wedding ceremony

07:29.330 --> 07:32.720
after the war ends.

07:34.580 --> 07:36.560
Your Majesty, it's a wise decision.

07:36.580 --> 07:38.370
See Prime Minister out.

07:39.330 --> 07:41.600
Your Majesty, I'm leaving too.

07:42.140 --> 07:43.150
You're still here?

07:43.170 --> 07:43.840
Yes.

07:43.860 --> 07:45.010
Okay.

07:59.770 --> 08:01.070
Eunuch Hou, don't bother.

08:01.090 --> 08:02.970
We'll leave by ourselves.

08:03.140 --> 08:06.130
I'd better see you out.

08:15.300 --> 08:16.640
Let's go.

08:21.820 --> 08:23.970
Si Gujian killed Lin Gong?

08:27.650 --> 08:30.000
It's ridiculous.

08:30.020 --> 08:31.640
It's true that Lin Gong was killed

08:31.770 --> 08:33.510
by a skilled swordsman.

08:33.530 --> 08:35.650
Do you think Lin Ruofu bought the story?

08:38.220 --> 08:40.600
It doesn't matter as long as the common people are convinced.

08:44.610 --> 08:45.960
Did you

08:46.020 --> 08:47.470
really see the Second Prince

08:47.490 --> 08:48.920
and Xie Bi'an that day?

08:49.410 --> 08:51.010
Yes, I did.

08:51.580 --> 08:54.040
Then the Second Prince couldn't have done that.

08:55.220 --> 08:57.120
Isn't it Si Gujian?

08:57.140 --> 08:58.660
Did a Great Master come here

08:58.660 --> 09:01.010
to kill Gong'er

09:01.050 --> 09:03.250
just for his two unknown followers?

09:04.370 --> 09:05.920
Uncle, you don't believe that?

09:07.140 --> 09:09.270
I'm not stupid.

09:09.290 --> 09:10.640
In this case,

09:10.660 --> 09:12.250
why didn't you say it out?

09:18.970 --> 09:22.640
His Majesty acted in concert with Chen Pingping

09:22.660 --> 09:25.080
just to draw a final decision.

09:25.100 --> 09:27.840
Nobody cares if I believe it or not.

09:28.100 --> 09:30.210
Is it the answer His Majesty wants?

09:31.580 --> 09:34.690
It's the answer Nanqing wants.

09:34.820 --> 09:38.150
It'll be used as a perfect excuse

09:38.170 --> 09:40.210
to send armed forces to attack Beiqi.

09:41.370 --> 09:46.330
The common people will be filled with a common hatred.

09:48.930 --> 09:51.370
What a good answer!

09:53.170 --> 09:55.690
How about the truth about Lin Gong's death?

10:02.170 --> 10:05.600
There'll be no truth at all.

10:07.490 --> 10:10.080
The reason why Nanqing wants to attack Beiqi

10:10.460 --> 10:12.890
has to be beyond all doubt.

10:16.530 --> 10:20.370
I won't be able to find out the truth anymore.

10:21.820 --> 10:23.960
All our grievances

10:24.340 --> 10:26.130
and sorrow

10:27.700 --> 10:31.600
have to be hidden behind that.

10:34.460 --> 10:39.520
I'm not a qualified father.

10:44.930 --> 10:46.920
I don't deserve to be his father.

11:00.140 --> 11:01.510
Lin Gong was really killed

11:01.530 --> 11:03.920
by a martial arts master.

11:04.820 --> 11:06.960
Is Wuzhu in the capital city or not?

11:07.050 --> 11:08.480
I don't know.

11:08.820 --> 11:10.600
No matter if he's here,

11:11.050 --> 11:14.010
we have to insist the killer should be Si Gujian.

11:14.930 --> 11:16.270
We can't let anyone else

11:16.290 --> 11:17.760
know that Wuzhu is alive.

11:17.780 --> 11:19.100
The Investigator's Office

11:19.100 --> 11:20.030
is erasing all information about him.

11:20.050 --> 11:21.720
Try to find him.

11:23.700 --> 11:25.840
Don't believe Chen Pingping.

11:26.100 --> 11:28.250
Stay away from him as much as possible.

11:29.490 --> 11:30.530
What kind of person is he?

11:30.530 --> 11:33.080
He's well known for being resourceful,

11:33.100 --> 11:35.890
capricious and ruthless.

11:36.020 --> 11:38.210
Nobody can gain an insight into his mind.

11:40.660 --> 11:41.680
Do you hold a post

11:41.700 --> 11:44.030
in the Investigator's Office?

11:44.050 --> 11:44.880
Yeah.

11:44.900 --> 11:46.720
Don't get involved too much.

11:47.370 --> 11:49.280
After you marry Wan'er,

11:49.490 --> 11:51.000
I'll find a way

11:51.020 --> 11:52.770
to transfer you to the Ministry of Personnel.

11:53.220 --> 11:55.040
It'll be safer to work there.

11:56.900 --> 11:58.280
Besides,

11:59.660 --> 12:01.450
don't be curious

12:01.780 --> 12:03.960
about the truth of Gong'er's death.

12:04.700 --> 12:05.930
Don't investigate it anymore.

12:05.930 --> 12:06.970
Of course I won't.

12:06.970 --> 12:08.510
The secrets behind all this

12:08.530 --> 12:11.270
will be more than you can bear.

12:11.290 --> 12:12.510
Uncle, did you

12:12.530 --> 12:14.280
guess who is the killer?

12:16.370 --> 12:17.710
Chen Pingping

12:17.730 --> 12:20.160
wouldn't forge the wounds.

12:20.930 --> 12:23.150
I'm afraid he was really killed

12:23.170 --> 12:24.920
by a Great Master.

12:28.290 --> 12:30.810
Among the four Great Masters,

12:31.490 --> 12:33.400
Ku He is in Beiqi,

12:33.610 --> 12:35.920
Si Gujian is in Dongyi

12:36.170 --> 12:38.960
and Ye Liuyun roams about the world.

12:39.370 --> 12:42.960
The three of them couldn't have done that.

12:43.340 --> 12:44.510
How about the last one?

12:44.530 --> 12:46.010
The last one

12:47.020 --> 12:50.040
is in the imperial palace.

12:54.100 --> 12:56.160
Who can order him to kill?

12:57.850 --> 12:59.960
The Great Master in the imperial palace

13:00.610 --> 13:04.030
will only listen to His Majesty.

13:04.050 --> 13:05.150
Uncle.

13:05.170 --> 13:06.650
Gong'er's death

13:06.820 --> 13:08.680
just gives His Majesty a good excuse

13:08.700 --> 13:10.400
to start the war.

13:11.410 --> 13:13.480
The timing is perfect.

13:15.490 --> 13:17.040
Do you suspect...

13:23.340 --> 13:24.960
I'm just

13:25.900 --> 13:28.350
talking about current affairs with you.

13:28.370 --> 13:30.810
I suspect nobody.

13:34.290 --> 13:36.890
Let's forget about it.

13:37.340 --> 13:39.770
Don't mention it again.

13:40.410 --> 13:41.960
I see.

13:42.970 --> 13:45.250
Spend more time with Wan'er.

13:46.410 --> 13:49.570
She has a good relationship with Gong'er

13:49.730 --> 13:52.280
and she's been in poor health.

13:53.050 --> 13:55.160
Don't let her

13:55.410 --> 13:57.130
come over for the funeral.

14:00.700 --> 14:02.950
Go to see her

14:02.970 --> 14:05.320
and try to cheer her up.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.420
Got it.

14:08.900 --> 14:11.400
I have something else to do. You can leave.

14:22.700 --> 14:23.640
What's up?

14:23.660 --> 14:25.250
Her Highness wants to see you.

14:31.290 --> 14:32.690
Show me the way.

14:39.220 --> 14:41.040
Take this. It must be sweet.

14:41.340 --> 14:43.450
You won't give short weight, right?

14:43.900 --> 14:44.730
Which one do you prefer?

14:44.730 --> 14:45.700
This one. I want this.

14:45.700 --> 14:46.960
Okay.

15:29.410 --> 15:33.280
Ruofu, don't be too sad.

15:34.170 --> 15:36.770
Your Highness, thank you for your care.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.470
I really appreciate it.

15:39.490 --> 15:40.220
Do you really have to

15:40.220 --> 15:42.040
talk to me like that?

15:42.170 --> 15:43.440
It makes you sound distant.

15:43.460 --> 15:45.370
You're a princess and I'm just a subordinate.

15:46.580 --> 15:47.510
Your Highness,

15:47.530 --> 15:49.400
you know well

15:50.020 --> 15:52.030
that you don't love me at all.

15:52.050 --> 15:52.950
You just want to

15:52.970 --> 15:54.470
take advantage of me

15:54.490 --> 15:56.010
as a powerful minister, right?

15:57.410 --> 15:59.480
I know you're angry.

15:59.530 --> 16:02.010
I don't mind you venting your anger on me.

16:03.460 --> 16:05.450
Gong'er is not my son,

16:05.820 --> 16:06.730
but I also want to

16:06.730 --> 16:07.760
find out the killer.

16:07.780 --> 16:09.570
Your Highness, don't bother.

16:10.460 --> 16:11.840
His Majesty is wise.

16:12.900 --> 16:15.520
He's found out the murderer.

16:16.490 --> 16:17.950
I know you're not convinced.

16:17.970 --> 16:18.910
Why do you want to see me?

16:18.930 --> 16:22.010
I've heard you insisted on

16:22.290 --> 16:24.000
Wan'er marrying Fan Xian.

16:24.020 --> 16:26.520
Your Highness, you're well-informed.

16:26.610 --> 16:28.030
She's my daughter.

16:28.050 --> 16:29.460
I don't want her to marry Fan Xian.

16:29.460 --> 16:30.530
He's a bumpkin.

16:30.530 --> 16:32.720
Do you hate to part with Wan'er

16:33.340 --> 16:35.010
or to lose control of Neiku?

16:35.260 --> 16:38.320
I didn't expect you'd look down upon me so much.

16:38.340 --> 16:39.520
Li Yunrui,

16:40.140 --> 16:41.560
we know each other so well.

16:41.580 --> 16:42.920
Don't pretend to

16:42.970 --> 16:43.850
be sad and sorrowful

16:43.850 --> 16:45.450
before me.

16:45.530 --> 16:47.320
I'm Wan'er's mother.

16:47.340 --> 16:48.890
I don't want her to marry him.

16:49.410 --> 16:50.850
Why don't you go to His Majesty?

16:50.850 --> 16:51.290
Do we really have to

16:51.290 --> 16:53.250
talk like this?

16:59.290 --> 17:00.350
Wan'er likes him.

17:00.370 --> 17:01.890
So what?

17:02.100 --> 17:03.270
Her marriage

17:03.290 --> 17:05.170
is up to you and me.

17:05.700 --> 17:07.480
Since she was born,

17:08.290 --> 17:09.720
I've seen her

17:09.740 --> 17:11.440
few times.

17:11.860 --> 17:13.440
I owe her too much.

17:14.250 --> 17:16.130
So, I don't want to stop her

17:16.340 --> 17:18.080
doing what she likes to do anymore.

17:19.170 --> 17:20.410
Besides,

17:20.860 --> 17:22.770
Fan Xian is nice to Dabao.

17:23.050 --> 17:25.010
I'll be relieved

17:25.050 --> 17:26.960
to let Fan Xian take care of the Lin family.

17:26.980 --> 17:28.100
Do you know

17:28.100 --> 17:29.290
he's a bastard son?

17:29.290 --> 17:30.720
It's easier to support someone without influence.

17:30.740 --> 17:33.290
Wouldn't you ever think about me?

17:34.500 --> 17:36.270
-Hurry. -Hurry.

17:36.290 --> 17:37.680
Slow down.

17:40.820 --> 17:44.440
Your Highness. Prime Minister.

17:45.460 --> 17:46.930
Li Yunrui,

17:47.580 --> 17:49.110
I've thought about it.

17:49.130 --> 17:51.480
Neiku is not yours.

17:52.620 --> 17:54.560
Let it go.

17:59.100 --> 18:00.720
We'd better

18:02.980 --> 18:04.890
not see each other again.

18:18.050 --> 18:21.080
Kill them and throw them into the river.

18:59.130 --> 19:01.560
Come here for fun!

19:02.770 --> 19:03.460
Sir,

19:03.460 --> 19:04.990
can you watch my kite for me?

19:05.010 --> 19:06.800
I want to go and play for a while.

19:08.220 --> 19:08.860
Go ahead.

19:08.860 --> 19:10.170
Thank you.

19:15.010 --> 19:16.250
Have you got over your cough?

19:16.250 --> 19:18.170
Why are you here alone?

19:29.380 --> 19:31.170
My second brother is dead.

19:31.700 --> 19:33.050
I know.

19:34.980 --> 19:36.290
I've heard

19:37.740 --> 19:40.250
it's he that plotted the Niulan Street assassination.

19:41.410 --> 19:42.770
Is it true?

19:43.220 --> 19:44.480
Yes.

19:44.500 --> 19:45.720
I remember

19:46.620 --> 19:47.560
Teng Zijing's death

19:47.580 --> 19:49.080
is a big blow to you.

19:51.290 --> 19:53.680
You'd been trying to find out the one behind it,

19:54.340 --> 19:55.480
right?

19:56.130 --> 19:57.370
Yeah.

20:05.380 --> 20:07.410
I have a question for you.

20:08.410 --> 20:09.930
Don't lie to me.

20:13.770 --> 20:15.080
Go ahead.

20:16.620 --> 20:18.050
I won't lie to you.

20:24.130 --> 20:25.560
Did you

20:32.930 --> 20:34.930
kill my second brother?

20:36.700 --> 20:37.930
No.

20:37.980 --> 20:39.530
Look at my eyes.

20:46.100 --> 20:47.840
I didn't

20:48.250 --> 20:49.840
kill Lin Gong.

21:16.770 --> 21:19.560
Knowing he was killed,

21:20.980 --> 21:23.600
I was both sad and worried.

21:24.650 --> 21:26.930
I was afraid it's you

21:27.580 --> 21:29.600
that killed him.

21:30.740 --> 21:32.770
Did you plan to kill me with that sword

21:35.820 --> 21:37.720
if it were me?

21:38.740 --> 21:41.200
I'd kill myself.

21:42.770 --> 21:44.560
It'd be too much for me to bear

21:45.820 --> 21:47.890
if it were you.

21:49.170 --> 21:51.720
I'd kill myself to keep Lin Gong company.

22:15.770 --> 22:16.910
Head,

22:16.930 --> 22:18.960
it's the cart of Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue ahead.

22:21.220 --> 22:22.150
Stop him.

22:22.170 --> 22:23.680
I have something to say to him.

22:23.700 --> 22:25.080
Got it.

22:32.930 --> 22:34.480
Keep your distance.

22:43.340 --> 22:47.170
I've got cold hands and feet. I feel tired.

22:49.410 --> 22:51.370
It's because of rapid changes in your mood.

22:51.410 --> 22:53.080
You'll be alright after having a rest.

22:53.580 --> 22:55.250
Head Chen said

22:56.380 --> 22:58.840
it's Si Gujian that killed my second brother.

23:01.050 --> 23:02.530
Yeah.

23:04.740 --> 23:06.290
He also said

23:06.980 --> 23:09.800
Beiqi cheated your second brother

23:10.620 --> 23:12.050
and took this opportunity to

23:12.890 --> 23:15.170
make mischief between Dongyi Town and Nanqing.

23:15.500 --> 23:17.290
What an insidious act!

23:18.130 --> 23:20.410
Luckily, Head Chen saw it through.

23:24.170 --> 23:25.890
His Majesty decided to send armed force to attack them.

23:27.340 --> 23:29.110
A war is coming?

23:29.130 --> 23:30.560
A nation's strength will be taken

23:30.580 --> 23:32.290
to avenge Lin Gong's death.

23:34.100 --> 23:35.800
Lots of people will die.

23:38.580 --> 23:40.250
You don't want to take revenge?

23:41.170 --> 23:42.480
Yes, I do.

23:42.500 --> 23:43.500
It's just that

23:43.500 --> 23:45.290
it'll get many innocent people involved.

23:47.220 --> 23:51.650
When will hatred end?

24:04.700 --> 24:06.200
Silly girl.

24:08.620 --> 24:10.370
Go to sleep.

24:13.700 --> 24:15.800
I questioned you today.

24:16.770 --> 24:18.320
Please don't get mad at me.

24:18.340 --> 24:19.720
How could I?

24:22.220 --> 24:23.530
I'll take you out of city

24:23.650 --> 24:25.230
for a walk in a few days.

24:25.250 --> 24:26.600
Out of city?

24:26.860 --> 24:28.030
Your condition will get worse

24:28.050 --> 24:29.720
if you stay here all the time.

24:29.740 --> 24:32.440
You'll feel better if you go out for a walk.

24:33.620 --> 24:35.530
It's okay as long as you stay with me.

24:36.010 --> 24:37.890
I'll always stay with you.

24:38.010 --> 24:39.370
Go to sleep.

24:39.980 --> 24:41.800
I'll leave after you fall asleep.

25:03.890 --> 25:04.740
It was quick.

25:04.740 --> 25:06.200
You took him back

25:06.290 --> 25:07.720
while I was not here.

25:07.740 --> 25:09.800
And you also found a good girl for him.

25:09.820 --> 25:11.220
I just want to use it as a chance

25:11.220 --> 25:12.560
to seize back Neiku.

25:12.580 --> 25:15.320
It's just about some money. Why don't you let it go?

25:15.340 --> 25:17.320
The Investigator's Office couldn't have been set up

25:17.340 --> 25:19.170
if she hadn't aided you financially.

25:19.170 --> 25:21.560
Neiku is the source of revenue for the royal household.

25:21.620 --> 25:23.250
If Fan Xian takes it over,

25:23.250 --> 25:25.630
he'll become a target for all.

25:25.650 --> 25:26.990
Listen to me.

25:27.010 --> 25:28.870
Invalidate their marriage contract.

25:28.890 --> 25:30.370
It's too late.

25:30.820 --> 25:33.250
He wants to marry that girl.

25:33.820 --> 25:35.750
The Ye family has lost control of Neiku.

25:35.770 --> 25:38.200
Why do you get Fan Xian involved?

25:39.580 --> 25:41.600
You wouldn't have given him that token

25:41.620 --> 25:43.560
if you wanted him to stay away from all this.

25:43.580 --> 25:44.890
You did that in the hope of

25:45.170 --> 25:46.960
letting him take over the Investigator's Office, right?

25:46.980 --> 25:49.360
I want him to inherit it.

25:49.380 --> 25:50.890
Both the Investigator's Office

25:50.890 --> 25:52.530
and Neiku are of great importance.

25:52.580 --> 25:54.150
His Majesty is of great talent and bold vision.

25:54.170 --> 25:55.700
I don't think he'd let Fan Xian hold the two posts concurrently.

25:55.700 --> 25:57.820
The Investigator's Office is in the teeth of the storm.

25:57.820 --> 25:59.100
Isn't it great to let Xian'er

25:59.100 --> 26:00.440
just be a rich guy?

26:02.290 --> 26:04.700
Without power, his wealth will finally

26:04.700 --> 26:06.150
become a castle in the air

26:06.170 --> 26:07.030
or an unrooted tree.

26:07.050 --> 26:08.110
I'll protect him.

26:08.130 --> 26:09.150
Don't forget

26:09.170 --> 26:10.390
he almost lost his life

26:10.410 --> 26:12.050
on Niulan Street.

26:12.130 --> 26:13.340
I won't let such a thing

26:13.340 --> 26:14.680
happen again.

26:14.700 --> 26:16.840
He'll have nothing to worry about

26:17.050 --> 26:18.800
if he takes over the Investigator's Office.

26:18.820 --> 26:20.270
It's the best way of survival

26:20.290 --> 26:22.440
to stay away from power struggle.

26:25.770 --> 26:26.620
It seems

26:26.620 --> 26:28.080
you can't convince me and vice versa.

26:28.100 --> 26:29.600
It's always the case.

26:32.220 --> 26:33.200
Fine.

26:33.220 --> 26:35.800
Let's try to do all we can respectively.

26:35.820 --> 26:37.200
Fan Xian's future

26:37.220 --> 26:38.910
will be up to himself.

26:38.930 --> 26:40.370
Okay.

27:11.250 --> 27:12.770
You don't want to take revenge?

27:13.530 --> 27:15.080
Yes, I do.

27:16.100 --> 27:17.170
It's just that

27:17.170 --> 27:18.890
it'll get many innocent people involved.

27:19.700 --> 27:21.930
When will hatred end?

27:22.770 --> 27:24.480
The capital city is a dangerous place.

27:24.530 --> 27:26.960
If you didn't choose to support someone,

27:26.980 --> 27:28.110
it could

27:28.130 --> 27:30.440
lead to your doom.

27:31.500 --> 27:33.290
Did you

27:33.650 --> 27:35.930
kill my second brother?

27:37.770 --> 27:41.410
I won't be able to find out the truth anymore.

27:42.980 --> 27:45.200
All our grievances

27:45.290 --> 27:47.010
and sorrow

27:48.650 --> 27:52.290
have to be hidden behind that.

27:53.700 --> 27:56.200
I'll take a nation's strength

27:56.220 --> 27:58.930
to punish the wicked.

27:59.170 --> 28:02.840
We have to start the war!

28:03.500 --> 28:05.390
Is it the answer His Majesty wants?

28:05.410 --> 28:09.840
It's the answer Nanqing wants.

28:18.580 --> 28:20.050
She said

28:20.340 --> 28:21.530
it means

28:21.530 --> 28:23.960
they've gone somewhere far far away.

28:24.890 --> 28:27.960
Someday, I'll also go there.

28:27.980 --> 28:29.840
When I see them again,

28:29.860 --> 28:31.440
I'll tell them

28:31.460 --> 28:34.770
it's been a long time and I miss them.

28:42.860 --> 28:44.800
The one behind the assassination attempt is extremely powerful

28:45.170 --> 28:47.890
now that it even dared to do it in public.

28:48.530 --> 28:50.290
This is just the beginning.

28:50.860 --> 28:52.410
The road ahead

28:52.580 --> 28:55.320
will be full of hazards.

29:26.220 --> 29:27.890
How do you know I'm here?

29:28.100 --> 29:31.480
I saw everything.

29:33.380 --> 29:35.270
Wan'er came to our mansion for you.

29:35.290 --> 29:35.890
She asked me a lot

29:35.890 --> 29:37.390
about your attitude toward Lin Gong.

29:37.410 --> 29:38.800
I was worried,

29:39.340 --> 29:42.680
so I followed her all the way.

29:45.500 --> 29:49.030
I promised never to lie to her.

29:49.050 --> 29:50.320
You didn't lie.

29:50.340 --> 29:52.200
Brother, you didn't kill Lin Gong.

29:52.220 --> 29:52.860
But I know

29:52.860 --> 29:54.560
it's Wuzhu that did it.

29:54.580 --> 29:56.050
I didn't tell her about that.

29:59.290 --> 30:00.680
Honesty is extremely important

30:01.530 --> 30:03.630
in a relationship.

30:03.650 --> 30:04.800
I know.

30:04.820 --> 30:06.230
But what's more important,

30:06.250 --> 30:08.270
you have to consider what'd happen if you tell the truth.

30:08.290 --> 30:09.630
Both of you would be in pain

30:09.650 --> 30:11.320
and then break up.

30:11.460 --> 30:13.560
It does no good to either of you.

30:14.250 --> 30:16.010
Wan'er is in poor health.

30:16.770 --> 30:19.010
How could she bear such suffering?

30:21.010 --> 30:21.700
But...

30:21.700 --> 30:23.370
No "but"!

30:24.130 --> 30:25.530
Brother,

30:26.290 --> 30:27.720
sometimes,

30:27.820 --> 30:29.390
lying with good intentions

30:29.410 --> 30:31.170
might be the right thing to do.

30:35.650 --> 30:37.270
Will you lie to me

30:37.290 --> 30:38.320
if anything happens to you?

30:38.340 --> 30:39.510
Of course I won't.

30:39.530 --> 30:40.700
But you just said...

30:40.700 --> 30:43.250
I won't marry you. Why would I lie to you?

30:51.860 --> 30:54.370
Fine. I can't refute what you said.

30:54.650 --> 30:56.680
Because it makes sense.

30:56.980 --> 30:57.820
Sometime, I think

30:57.820 --> 30:58.380
you're similar

30:58.380 --> 30:59.800
to Wuzhu.

31:00.580 --> 31:01.600
Really?

31:01.620 --> 31:02.410
Is he

31:02.410 --> 31:04.530
as beautiful as me?

31:07.220 --> 31:09.170
Thank you for coming here and comforting me.

31:09.220 --> 31:10.480
I feel better.

31:10.500 --> 31:13.030
I've heard you were summoned to the imperial palace again.

31:13.050 --> 31:14.410
How did it come out?

31:14.820 --> 31:16.410
Lin Gong's case is resolved.

31:16.820 --> 31:17.870
So quick!

31:17.890 --> 31:18.990
It's a little complicated.

31:19.010 --> 31:21.170
I'll explain it to you on our way back.

31:27.170 --> 31:28.200
Do you mean

31:28.220 --> 31:29.630
His Majesty wants to take this opportunity

31:29.650 --> 31:31.130
to dispatch troops to attack Beiqi?

31:31.250 --> 31:32.390
As an onlooker,

31:32.410 --> 31:34.370
I think it's a complicated situation.

31:34.740 --> 31:37.560
The Second Prince, the Crown Prince, the Prime Minister

31:37.580 --> 31:39.320
and even Chen Pingping

31:39.340 --> 31:41.440
are against each other.

31:43.820 --> 31:46.600
Chen Pingping is protective towards you.

31:46.860 --> 31:49.170
The Prime Minister is your future father-in-law.

31:49.290 --> 31:51.650
The Second Prince treats you like a friend.

31:51.860 --> 31:53.370
Except the Crown Prince,

31:54.130 --> 31:56.680
everyone else is nice to you.

31:57.100 --> 31:58.480
In this case,

31:58.740 --> 32:00.360
you're extraordinary

32:00.380 --> 32:02.960
at associating with people.

32:02.980 --> 32:04.080
Are you trying to make fun of me?

32:04.100 --> 32:06.200
You can realize it, anyway.

32:07.130 --> 32:09.200
Each of them has their own perspective,

32:09.220 --> 32:10.270
but there is one

32:10.290 --> 32:11.720
with whom I think something is going wrong.

32:11.740 --> 32:12.360
Who is it?

32:12.380 --> 32:13.560
The Crown Prince.

32:14.340 --> 32:15.680
What's wrong?

32:15.700 --> 32:17.320
Without any other evidence

32:17.770 --> 32:19.270
except that Lin Gong was killed by a skilled swordsman,

32:19.290 --> 32:21.230
he even accused Li Chengze of murder.

32:21.250 --> 32:22.910
When his argument was refuted easily,

32:22.930 --> 32:24.270
he didn't do anything else to justify himself.

32:24.290 --> 32:25.800
Don't you think he's too reckless?

32:25.820 --> 32:27.110
Anything wrong?

32:27.130 --> 32:29.250
The Crown Prince showed his recklessness,

32:29.380 --> 32:31.600
but nobody was surprised.

32:31.620 --> 32:32.990
Even Chen Pingping

32:33.010 --> 32:35.080
didn't think anything went wrong.

32:35.460 --> 32:38.650
Brother, it's not been long since you came to the capital city.

32:38.820 --> 32:39.990
People say

32:40.010 --> 32:41.720
the Crown Prince has little talent and learning

32:41.740 --> 32:42.960
and handles matters recklessly.

32:42.980 --> 32:44.530
Everyone is used to it.

32:44.580 --> 32:47.230
That's why many people

32:47.250 --> 32:49.110
changed to support the Second Prince.

32:49.130 --> 32:50.390
I'm not used to it,

32:50.410 --> 32:51.930
so I think it's weird.

32:52.290 --> 32:53.650
If the Crown Prince really has little talent

32:53.650 --> 32:54.910
as they said,

32:54.930 --> 32:56.230
how could he have stayed in the Eastern Palace

32:56.250 --> 32:57.630
for such a long time?

32:57.650 --> 33:00.150
Maybe His Majesty is protective of him.

33:00.170 --> 33:01.600
Is that all?

33:01.740 --> 33:02.910
Besides Chen Pingping

33:02.930 --> 33:05.130
and Lin Ruofu who are full of cunny tricks,

33:05.290 --> 33:07.840
His Majesty and the Second Prince are also there.

33:08.500 --> 33:10.720
If the Crown Prince had any plot,

33:10.820 --> 33:13.170
they must've have seen it through.

33:13.410 --> 33:14.630
Besides,

33:14.650 --> 33:16.560
what happened today was a complete farce.

33:17.220 --> 33:19.370
It did no good to him at all.

33:23.250 --> 33:25.320
I wish it's me that thought too much.

33:37.050 --> 33:37.960
Your Highness,

33:37.980 --> 33:39.360
flowers in the backyard are in bloom.

33:39.380 --> 33:40.890
How about going out for a walk?

33:40.890 --> 33:44.510
His Majesty asked me to stay inside for three days.

33:44.530 --> 33:46.800
It's our own yard.

33:46.860 --> 33:49.320
I need to put a stop to all distracting thoughts.

33:50.700 --> 33:52.320
You can leave.

33:52.500 --> 33:53.770
Got it.

34:12.820 --> 34:14.450
His Highness offended His Majesty again.

34:14.450 --> 34:15.990
What should we do?

34:16.010 --> 34:17.120
He's impulsive.

34:17.140 --> 34:18.080
If it goes on like this,

34:18.100 --> 34:19.620
how could he defeat the Second Prince?

34:19.620 --> 34:20.940
Yeah. I've heard the Second Prince...

34:20.940 --> 34:21.920
Hush!

34:21.940 --> 34:22.800
Got it.

34:22.820 --> 34:24.890
Stop gossiping. Go.

35:35.380 --> 35:37.730
Si Lili.

35:38.940 --> 35:40.650
I'm Chen Pingping.

35:42.420 --> 35:44.130
You must've heard that

35:44.490 --> 35:46.840
I'm in charge of everything in the Investigator's Office.

35:46.860 --> 35:48.230
I have a question.

35:48.250 --> 35:49.470
Did you tell Fan Xian

35:49.490 --> 35:51.400
it's Lin Gong

35:51.420 --> 35:53.170
that plotted the Niulan Street assassination?

35:54.340 --> 35:58.190
No. I didn't.

35:58.210 --> 35:59.800
You shouldn't have hesitated.

36:04.690 --> 36:06.240
Tomorrow morning at the imperial court,

36:06.940 --> 36:09.750
His Majesty will tell everyone secret agents of Beiqi

36:09.770 --> 36:12.670
sowed discord between Nanqing and Dongyi Town

36:12.690 --> 36:13.530
and assassinated

36:13.530 --> 36:14.970
the second son of the Prime Minister,

36:14.970 --> 36:17.000
so we'll declare war on Beiqi.

36:17.210 --> 36:18.880
The Nanqing army will

36:18.900 --> 36:20.600
set foot on the border

36:20.620 --> 36:22.410
and attack Beiqi in a day.

36:23.180 --> 36:25.490
Sowed discord between Nanqing and Dongyi Town?

36:25.490 --> 36:28.360
Si Gujian killed Lin Gong.

36:28.380 --> 36:29.380
It's Beiqi

36:29.380 --> 36:31.760
that plotted this matter.

36:33.490 --> 36:34.890
Si Gujian?

36:37.250 --> 36:38.530
As a secret agent of Beiqi,

36:38.530 --> 36:41.760
you're supposed to be killed before the war starts.

36:43.690 --> 36:45.600
But I'm the only one

36:47.820 --> 36:49.730
that can keep you safe.

36:50.250 --> 36:51.650
Understand?

36:59.860 --> 37:01.230
What's the price for it?

37:01.250 --> 37:02.470
From now on,

37:02.490 --> 37:03.380
no matter who asks you

37:03.380 --> 37:04.320
the question I asked just now,

37:04.340 --> 37:05.510
don't hesitate.

37:05.530 --> 37:07.130
There is only one answer:

37:07.340 --> 37:09.030
you didn't tell Fan Xian the truth.

37:09.050 --> 37:12.600
Fan Xian doesn't have reason to kill Lin Gong.

37:15.970 --> 37:17.650
Who is he to you?

37:18.290 --> 37:19.710
What's your relationship?

37:19.730 --> 37:21.410
If you give the wrong answer,

37:21.490 --> 37:24.170
nobody can keep you safe.

37:49.010 --> 37:51.160
If you want to protect Fan Xian,

37:51.180 --> 37:53.320
you just need to kill Si Lili.

37:54.420 --> 37:56.760
Fan Xian promised to spare her life.

37:57.140 --> 37:58.690
Even I am curious

37:58.900 --> 38:00.650
who he is to you.

38:01.860 --> 38:03.280
An old friend.

38:03.770 --> 38:06.000
He was brought up in Danzhou.

38:06.340 --> 38:08.520
How could you have met him?

38:10.010 --> 38:11.600
Ruohai,

38:14.100 --> 38:16.690
how long have you been working here?

38:16.860 --> 38:18.210
I don't remember.

38:18.290 --> 38:19.450
Among all directors,

38:19.450 --> 38:20.380
only two can bear heavy responsibilities.

38:20.380 --> 38:21.140
One is you

38:21.140 --> 38:23.600
and the other is Zhu Ge of the First Division.

38:26.250 --> 38:29.730
On terms of experience and personal feeling,

38:32.050 --> 38:34.320
the next Head of the Investigator's Office

38:34.340 --> 38:36.690
will be one of you.

38:40.970 --> 38:42.560
Why are you mentioning this?

38:43.490 --> 38:45.080
If Fan Xian

38:45.420 --> 38:47.120
is the next Head of the Investigator's Office,

38:47.140 --> 38:48.800
what do you think?

38:51.530 --> 38:53.400
The Investigator's Office is yours.

38:53.420 --> 38:55.710
You can hand it over

38:55.730 --> 38:57.130
to anyone you like.

39:02.380 --> 39:04.130
Would you kill me

39:05.100 --> 39:06.600
if I had expressed my discontentment?

39:06.690 --> 39:08.080
We've been working together for years.

39:08.100 --> 39:09.600
How could I do that?

39:09.620 --> 39:11.360
We've been working together for years,

39:11.380 --> 39:13.080
so I could tell

39:13.490 --> 39:17.410
you wanted to kill me when I looked at your eyes.

39:45.690 --> 39:47.000
Uncle.

39:47.050 --> 39:48.510
Be careful when you come here again.

39:48.530 --> 39:49.420
That guy called Shadow

39:49.420 --> 39:50.320
keeps following me.

39:50.340 --> 39:52.320
He's gone back to the Investigator's Office.

39:52.820 --> 39:54.240
You knew that?

39:54.970 --> 39:56.930
Chen Pingping wants to protect you.

39:58.860 --> 40:00.210
Why?

40:00.450 --> 40:02.170
Of course it's because of Lady Ye.

40:04.580 --> 40:06.320
Who is my mom to him?

40:08.690 --> 40:10.240
I can't remember.

40:10.620 --> 40:11.970
I just know

40:12.580 --> 40:14.410
it's Chen Pingping's black knights

40:14.900 --> 40:17.210
that took revenge in the capital city

40:18.380 --> 40:20.800
after Lady Ye was killed.

40:21.690 --> 40:23.210
It turns out it's him.

40:37.140 --> 40:38.840
I remember.

40:40.690 --> 40:42.560
You have her eyes.

40:43.180 --> 40:44.640
Who is she?

40:44.660 --> 40:46.280
Ye Qingmei.

40:48.690 --> 40:51.210
What's so magical about my mom?

40:51.730 --> 40:53.730
She's the guider

40:54.140 --> 40:56.000
and the betrayer.

40:57.690 --> 40:59.510
She's like Nuwa who repaired the heaven.

40:59.530 --> 41:00.900
She's the cause of every phenomenon on earth.

41:00.900 --> 41:02.600
She's the end of finality.

41:04.730 --> 41:06.000
Uncle.

41:08.420 --> 41:10.280
What am I talking about?

41:21.340 --> 41:22.650
Don't you know

41:23.010 --> 41:25.080
what you just said?

41:25.250 --> 41:26.560
I said them out

41:28.100 --> 41:29.970
before I knew it.

41:31.970 --> 41:34.080
They might come from the depths of my memory,

41:36.010 --> 41:38.080
but I can't remember.

41:49.490 --> 41:50.250
It's alright.

41:50.250 --> 41:52.080
Take your time if you can't remember.

41:53.580 --> 41:54.800
Uncle.

41:56.250 --> 41:58.690
What's up, Uncle Wuzhu?

42:00.820 --> 42:02.040
Uncle.

42:04.770 --> 42:05.970
Uncle.

42:07.180 --> 42:08.370
Uncle Wuzhu.

42:15.340 --> 42:18.080
Uncle! Uncle!

42:22.340 --> 42:23.140
I think I remember

42:23.140 --> 42:24.890
where the Taiping Residence is.

42:25.660 --> 42:27.170
Where is it?

42:30.580 --> 42:33.280
2.5 km east of the city.

42:56.080 --> 42:59.660
In the river of history,

42:59.680 --> 43:03.150
time goes round and round.

43:05.960 --> 43:09.300
Memories about the former and present lives

43:09.320 --> 43:13.390
join each other in an endless way.

43:15.280 --> 43:17.900
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:17.920 --> 43:20.160
one season follows another in a flash,

43:20.160 --> 43:22.660
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:22.680 --> 43:24.280
I just can't give up

43:24.280 --> 43:27.620
to be with you for my whole life.

43:27.640 --> 43:33.110
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:34.360 --> 43:36.910
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:37.200 --> 43:39.240
Year after year in the wandering,

43:39.240 --> 43:41.900
I count the remaining years.

43:41.920 --> 43:44.100
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:44.120 --> 43:46.110
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:46.400 --> 43:48.790
I never feel regretful.

43:48.840 --> 43:50.200
In such a chaotic world,

43:50.200 --> 43:53.180
I still miss you as ever.

43:53.200 --> 43:56.150
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:56.440 --> 43:58.500
With a gentle heart,

43:58.520 --> 44:01.180
I cherish our remaining years.

44:01.200 --> 44:02.720
Even though we have to go through

44:02.720 --> 44:05.230
all the hardships along the journey,

44:05.360 --> 44:12.550
you always stay by my side,

44:12.640 --> 44:15.310
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:15.600 --> 44:17.680
Year after year in the wandering,

44:17.680 --> 44:20.340
I count the remaining years.

44:20.360 --> 44:22.500
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:22.520 --> 44:24.750
even though we end up the destiny,

44:24.960 --> 44:27.140
I never feel regretful.

44:27.160 --> 44:28.560
In such a chaotic world,

44:28.560 --> 44:31.620
I still miss you as ever.

44:31.640 --> 44:34.750
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:34.840 --> 44:36.980
With a gentle heart,

44:37.000 --> 44:39.700
I cherish our remaining years.

44:39.720 --> 44:41.160
Even though we have to go through

44:41.160 --> 44:43.820
all the hardships along the journey,

